/**
 * Computes the query string to attach to a side-nav link based on the current and target tabs.
 *
 * - Navigating between two traces-related tabs preserves ALL current query params (both time
 *   range params and traces-specific params such as selectedTraceId).
 * - Navigating into, out of, or entirely outside the traces tab group preserves ONLY the time
 *   range params (e.g. startTimeLabel, startTime); all other tab-specific params are dropped.
 *
